# decision-defined-as-exists root (#189 IMPL 3 fold fix / #270)
library "Pol".

// A decision + `code is` library whose decision guard is a `defined as exists`
// concept. `defined as exists` lowers on the STANDARD lane (#265) AND, since #270
// (Slice 0a), on the case-feature Inferred lane the interface split uses — to the
// same bare scalar `exists(<X>)` (`emitCQL.emitExistsBridge`), re-exported BARE by
// the Interface façade (`srcIsExists`). This fixture now emits successfully on both
// the CQL and FHIR lanes; before #270 it threw the untyped `definedAsExistsNotLowered`
// and the FHIR fold sank success (regression pinned in closureOrchestrator.test.ts).

concept "Adult Patient":
- type is Observation.
- shape is RecordSet.
- code is `adult`.

concept "Has Adult":
- value type is boolean.
- defined as exists ( "Adult Patient" ).

activity "Refer":
- request CPGServiceRequest.

decision "Triage":
- when "Has Adult" then recommend activity "Refer".
